<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <title>Add email · bitcoin++</title>
  {{ block "header" . }} {{ end }}
</head>
<body class="btcpp-profile-edit-page">
  {{ block "mainnav" . }} {{ end }}

  <main class="profile-edit-shell person-emails-page">
    <header class="profile-edit-hero">
      <p class="profile-edit-tag">§ ACCOUNT</p>
      <h1>Add this <span>email.</span></h1>
      <p>Confirm that this email should be attached to the bitcoin++ account that requested it.</p>
    </header>

    {{ if .Error }}
      <div class="profile-edit-flash person-emails-error">{{ .Error }}</div>
      <p><a href="/dashboard/emails">Return to email addresses →</a></p>
    {{ else }}
      <section class="profile-edit-section is-open">
        <div class="profile-edit-section__index">✓</div>
        <div class="profile-edit-section__body">
          <div class="profile-edit-section__head"><div><p>§ VERIFY EMAIL</p><h2>Add {{ .Email }}?</h2></div></div>
          <p>Press the button below to verify <strong>{{ .Email }}</strong> and add it to the bitcoin++ account for <strong>{{ .RequesterEmail }}</strong>. Nothing will change until you confirm.</p>
          <form method="POST" action="/dashboard/emails/verify" class="person-merge-review person-email-verification-form">
            <input type="hidden" name="token" value="{{ .Token }}">
            <button type="submit">Verify and add this email</button>
          </form>
          <p><small>If you did not request this, close this page. The email will not be added.</small></p>
        </div>
      </section>
    {{ end }}
  </main>

  {{ block "footer" . }} {{ end }}
</body>
</html>
